<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.Label.Adding>添加模组相关的修复：</MidSaverSaver.Settings.Label.Adding>
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.Label.Removing>删除模组相关的修复：</MidSaverSaver.Settings.Label.Removing>
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.Label.Misc>杂项：</MidSaverSaver.Settings.Label.Misc>
  <!--At least one fix needed to run (check the debug console for details).  In order for the fixes to propagate, save your game now, and then load that save.  You do not need to restart the whole game.-->
  <MidSaverSaver.ReloadNow>至少需要运行一个修复程序(查看调试控制台获取详细信息)。为了使修复有效，请立即保存游戏，然后加载该存档。您不需要重新启动游戏。</MidSaverSaver.ReloadNow>
  <MidSaverSaver.ReloadNow.Header>Mid-saver Saver：需要重新加载</MidSaverSaver.ReloadNow.Header>
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.DisableCompression>修复哈希冲突</MidSaverSaver.Settings.DisableCompression>
  <!--If you encounter a hash collision after adding a mod, you may notice problems such as:\n\n\n1.) Stone cliffs or chunks have disappeared, or have transformed into a different item.\n\n2.)The deep drill is turning up unusual items.\n\nTo use this fix correctly, you must enable it *before* you add the new mod, then save your game with it enabled. This creates a save without any compression (lossy compression is the source of this problem). Then you can add the mod, and you're free disable this setting or disable this mod entirely.-->
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.DisableCompression.Desc>如果您在添加模组后遇到哈希冲突，可能会出现这样的问题:\n\n\n1.)岩石或石块消失了，或者变成了不同的东西。\n\n2.)深钻井挖掘出了一些不寻常的东西。\n\n要正确使用该修复，您必须在添加新模组*之前*启用它，然后保存游戏。这将创建一个没有任何压缩的存档(有损压缩是导致此问题的原因)。然后，您可以添加模组，并自由选择禁用该设置或完全禁用此模组。</MidSaverSaver.Settings.DisableCompression.Desc>
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.GenerateMissingMineables>生成缺失矿物</MidSaverSaver.Settings.GenerateMissingMineables>
  <!--If you add a mod that adds new things to mine, such as metal, coal, etc, this patch will retroactively generate them on existing maps. Enable it and then load your save to trigger the patch.\n\nThis setting is not saved and will be turned off next game restart.-->
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.GenerateMissingMineables.Desc>如果您添加了一个增加新矿物（如金属、煤炭等）的模组，该修复将会在现有的地图上生成它们。启用它，然后加载您的存档以触发修复。\n\n此设置不保存，并且在下次游戏重启时将关闭。</MidSaverSaver.Settings.GenerateMissingMineables.Desc>
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixCorruptWorldObjects>派系移除修复</MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixCorruptWorldObjects>
  <!--If you remove a faction, you may be unable to view the world map, or load any new saves created after you removed the factions. To use this fix:\n\n\n1.) Enable it and load your save with the faction mod(s) removed. You will get many red errors, but ignore them. The console may mention something about corrupt world objects being removed.\n\n2.) Save your game.\n\n3.) Check if you can load your save. If you can, you're good to go and should disable this fix, or even the mod entirely.-->
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixCorruptWorldObjects.Desc>如果您移除了一个派系，可能会导致无法查看世界地图，或无法加载移除派系后创建的新存档。使用此修复:\n\n\n1.)开启此选项并加载移除了派系模组的存档。会有很多红字，无视它们就好。控制台信息可能会提到某些损坏的世界对象被移除了。\n\n2.)保存游戏。\n\n3.)检查是否可以正常加载存档。如果可以，请禁用该设置，甚至完全移除该模组。</MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixCorruptWorldObjects.Desc>
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixCorruptSectors>修复损坏的区域和组件</MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixCorruptSectors>
  <!--If you remove a mod that had custom coded areas or section layers, it could corrupt the map's managers for these components. When this happens you'll get a "grey screen of death" on loading a save. This fix will regenerate them:\n\n\n1.) Enable it and load your save with the mod(s) removed. You will get many red errors, but ignore them.\n\n2.) Save your game.\n\n4.) Check if you can load your save. If you can, you're good to go and should disable this fix, or even the mod entirely. If your areas were corrupted, you'll need to build these yourself (the home area, roofing areas, snow clear areas, etc).-->
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixCorruptSectors.Desc>如果您移除了添加自定义区域或组件的模组，它可能会破坏这些组件的地图管理器。当这种情况发生时，您会在加载存档时看到“灰屏死机”。该修复将重新生成它们：\n\n\n1.)开启此选项并加载移除了区域和组件模组的存档。会有很多红字，但无视它们就好。\n\n2.)保存游戏。\n\n3.)检查是否可以正常加载存档。如果可以，请禁用该设置，甚至完全移除该模组。如果您的区域被破坏了，您需要自己创建这些区域(居住区域，屋顶区域，积雪清扫区域等)。</MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixCorruptSectors.Desc>
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixCorruptWeather>修复损坏的天气</MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixCorruptWeather>
  <!--If you remove a mod that added custom weather, you may get the "grey screen of death" on load. This fix will reset the weather system:\n\n\n1.) Enable it and load your save with the mod(s) removed. You will get many red errors, but ignore them.\n\n2.) Save your game.\n\n4.) Check if you can load your save. If you can, you're good to go and should disable this fix, or even the mod entirely. Weather will be set to the vanilla "clear" weather def for all corrupted maps.-->
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixCorruptWeather.Desc>如果您移除了添加自定义天气的模组，您可能会在加载时看到“灰屏死机”。该修复将重置天气系统:\n\n\n1.)开启此选项并加载移除了天气模组的存档。会有很多红字，但无视它们就好。\n\n2.)保存游戏。\n\n3.)检查是否可以正常加载存档。如果可以，请禁用该设置，甚至完全移除该模组。如果可以加载，所有损坏的地图的天气将被设置为“晴”。</MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixCorruptWeather.Desc>
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixCorruptIdeos>修复损坏的意识形态</MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixCorruptIdeos>
  <!--If you open the ideologies UI and get bombarded by errors while browsing it, this may be due to corrupt precepts. This fix will remove them:\n\n\n1.) Enable it and load your save with the mod(s) removed. You will get many red errors, but ignore them. The debug console may mention corrupt precepts being removed.\n\n2.) Save your game.\n\n3.) Check if you can load your save. If you can, you're good to go and should disable this fix, or even the mod entirely. You may want to edit the ideology to fill in any missing precepts.-->
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixCorruptIdeos.Desc>如果您打开意识形态界面并在浏览时遇到大量错误，这可能是由于损坏的戒律。此修复将删除它们\n\n\n1.)开启此选项并加载您模组被移除后的存档。会有很多红字，但无视它们就好。调试控制台可能会提到损坏的戒律被删除。\n\n2.)保存游戏。\n\n3.)检查是否可以正常加载存档。如果可以，请禁用该设置，甚至完全移除该模组。您可能需要编辑意识形态，以填补任何缺失的戒律。</MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixCorruptIdeos.Desc>
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixMissingStuff>修复缺失的材料</MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixMissingStuff>
  <!--If you remove a mod that added "stuff" (materials that buildings and items are built out of, like steel and wood), anything that used those materials will load in a quirked state. This fix will check for this and give them a fallback material based on commonality:\n\n\n1.) Enable it and load your save with the mod(s) removed. You will get many red errors, but ignore them. The debug console may mention that things with missing materials were fixed.\n\n2.) Disable this patch once done.-->
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixMissingStuff.Desc>如果您删除了一个添加了“材料”(建筑和物品的材料，如钢铁和木材)的模组，使用这些材料的任何东西将在加载时呈现异常状态。开启该选项以修复这一点，并替换为备用材料：\n\n\n1.)开启此选项并加载您模组被移除后的存档。会有很多红字，但无视它们就好。调试控制台可能会提到缺失材料的东西已经修复。一旦修复完成，请禁用该设置。</MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixMissingStuff.Desc>
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixMisc>修复不常见问题</MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixMisc>
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixMisc.Desc>修复一些不常见小问题的杂项。</MidSaverSaver.Settings.FixMisc.Desc>
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.DisableErrorSpamControl>暂时禁用报错上限限制(危险)</MidSaverSaver.Settings.DisableErrorSpamControl>
  <!--When removing mods, you may need to see more errors than the error spam controller allows. You can use this option to disable this safeguard. This option is not saved, and will reset to normal upon restarting the game.\n\nWARNING: Do not leave the game running if you're being bombarded by errors. Without spam control, your error log's file size will bloat multiple gigabytes.-->
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.DisableErrorSpamControl.Desc>当移除模组时，您可能需要看到比日志控制器上限更多的错误。您可以使用此选项禁用此保护措施。该选项不会被保存，并且会在重新开始游戏时重置。警告:如果您收到大量错误，请不要让游戏继续运行。没有上限控制，错误日志文件大小将膨胀到gb级别。</MidSaverSaver.Settings.DisableErrorSpamControl.Desc>
  <MidSaverSaver.Alert.MidSaverSaver.Label>Mid-saver Saver 激活</MidSaverSaver.Alert.MidSaverSaver.Label>
  <MidSaverSaver.Alert.MidSaverSaver.Desc>Mid-saver Saver的一个修复程序当前处于激活状态。这些修复并不意味着在您玩游戏时被动启用。仅在需要修复问题时使用它们。</MidSaverSaver.Alert.MidSaverSaver.Desc>
  <MidSaverSaver.Alert.ErrorSpamControl.Label>日志保险已禁用</MidSaverSaver.Alert.ErrorSpamControl.Label>
  <MidSaverSaver.Alert.ErrorSpamControl.Desc>Mid-saver暂时禁用了错误日志上限。请小心使用此选项，因为日志文件的大小可能会迅速扩大，可能会耗尽所有磁盘空间。</MidSaverSaver.Alert.ErrorSpamControl.Desc>
  <MidSaverSaver.Map>地图</MidSaverSaver.Map>
  <MidSaverSaver.GenerateMineable.Header>Mid-saver Saver：正在生成缺失的矿物</MidSaverSaver.GenerateMineable.Header>
  <!--No {0} was detected on the map "{1}". Would you like to retroactively generate it?\n\nNote regarding balanced gameplay: Due to pre-existing mineable clumps, the quantity generated here will not perfectly match what would have generated on a fresh map. Each time you add new clumps, the accuracy will degrade on future retroactive generations. Therefore, if you're planning on adding new mineable content, do so as few times as possible.\n\nWarning: The map will need to be refogged once this is complete.-->
  <MidSaverSaver.GenerateMineable>在地图"{1}"上没有探测到 {0} 。您想要重新生成它吗？\n\n关于平衡游戏的注意事项：由于现有的可采矿物，数量不会完全匹配在新地图上的数量。每次添加新的块，在以后生成时精度会下降。因此，如果您打算添加新的矿物内容，请尽量减少添加的次数。\n\n警告:完成此操作后，地图将重新进入迷雾状态。</MidSaverSaver.GenerateMineable>
  <MidSaverSaver.GenerateMineable.Confirm>生成</MidSaverSaver.GenerateMineable.Confirm>
  <MidSaverSaver.GenerateMineable.Skip>跳过</MidSaverSaver.GenerateMineable.Skip>
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.RemapBodyDefs>修复身体部位</MidSaverSaver.Settings.RemapBodyDefs>
  <!--If you install a mod that modifies the number of body parts (like adding a tail, new limbs, etc), this can cause pre-existing prosthetics and other hediffs to jumble into the wrong body parts, like a nose implant suddenly being on the ear slot. To use this fix:\n\n\n1.) Enable it and save your game *before* adding the new mod. This will record how the bodies used to look.\n\n2.) Cancel any pending medical operations that target body parts.\n\n3.) Enable the mod and load your save.\n\n4.) Save your game, and disable this patch.-->
  <MidSaverSaver.Settings.RemapBodyDefs.Desc>如果您安装了一个修改身体部位数量的模组(比如增加一条尾巴，新的肢体等)，这可能会导致预先存在的义肢和其他状态混入错误的身体部位，比如鼻子植入物突然出现在耳槽上。使用此修复:\n\n\n1.)*在添加新的模组之前*，启用它并保存您的游戏。这将记录身体以前的样子。\n\n2.)取消任何针对身体部位的未执行医疗手术。\n\n3.)启用模组并加载存档。\n\n4.)保存您的游戏，并禁用该选项。</MidSaverSaver.Settings.RemapBodyDefs.Desc>
  <MidSaverSaver.BodyMap.Header>Mid-saver Saver：正在修复身体部位</MidSaverSaver.BodyMap.Header>
  <MidSaverSaver.BodyMapSaved>{0} 身体defs已记录。您应该取消任何针对身体部位的医疗手术，然后保存游戏。之后，关闭游戏，加载新的模组。</MidSaverSaver.BodyMapSaved>
  <MidSaverSaver.BodyMapWritten>已重新映射世界各地所有角色和动物的 {0} 身体部位和状态。您需要保存，然后重新加载以完成该过程(一些单位的生命值在重新加载时才会看起来正确)。</MidSaverSaver.BodyMapWritten>
</LanguageData>